; Zone climates (read by src/weather.c at boot).
;
; Every zone gets a climate from the sectors of its outdoor rooms (a quarter
; glacier: arctic; 30% mountain: cold; 30% desert: desert; 30% jungle:
; tropical; otherwise temperate).  Many zones were built before those sector
; types existed, so this file overrides the guess: one "<zone> <climate>"
; per line, the climate being temperate, cold, arctic, desert or tropical.
; Lines starting with ';' are comments; the file ends with '$'.
;
; Relative to temperate: cold -8 degrees, arctic -18, desert +12 by day and
; -6 at night, tropical +8.

410 desert      ; Desert of Desolation
53  desert      ; Arena / Desert of Demise
58  tropical    ; The Jungle (and the Isle of Karras)
250 cold        ; Western Mountain
328 cold        ; Kehrn Mountains
$
